[
  {
    "content_id": "10031001001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "俄巴底亞書 1:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "31001001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;以下是俄巴底亞看到的異象。 我們從耶和華那裡聽到消息， 有位使者被派去對列國說： 「起來，我們去攻打以東吧！」 關於以東，主耶和華說：</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10031001002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "俄巴底亞書 1:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "31001002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;「看啊，我要使你在列國中最弱小， 備受藐視。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10031001003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "俄巴底亞書 1:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "31001003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;你住在巖穴中， 居住在高山上， 自以為誰也不能把你拉下來， 但你的驕傲欺騙了你。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10031001004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "俄巴底亞書 1:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "31001004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;即使你如鷹高飛， 在星辰間搭窩， 我也必把你拉下來。 這是耶和華說的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10031001005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "俄巴底亞書 1:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "31001005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;「盜賊夜間來你家， 難道不只偷所需要的嗎？ 人們到你那裡摘葡萄， 難道不留下幾串嗎？ 但你會被徹底毀滅！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10031001006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "俄巴底亞書 1:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "31001006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;以掃要被洗劫一空， 他藏的珍寶要被搜去。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10031001007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "俄巴底亞書 1:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "31001007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;你的盟友將你逐出家園； 你的朋友欺騙你，戰勝你； 你的知己設陷阱害你， 你卻懵然不知。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10031001008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "俄巴底亞書 1:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "31001008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;耶和華說：「到那天， 我要毀滅以東的智者， 除掉以掃山上的明哲。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10031001009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "俄巴底亞書 1:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "31001009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;提幔的勇士必驚慌失措， 以掃山上的人盡遭殺戮。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10031001010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "俄巴底亞書 1:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "31001010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;「因你曾殘暴地對待同胞兄弟雅各， 你必蒙羞，永遭毀滅。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10031001011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "俄巴底亞書 1:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "31001011",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;當外人掠奪雅各的財物、 異族攻入耶路撒冷的城門抽籤分贓時， 你竟然袖手旁觀， 就像他們的同夥一樣。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10031001012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "俄巴底亞書 1:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "31001012",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;你的親族遭難之日， 你不該幸災樂禍； 猶大人被滅的日子， 你不該興高采烈； 他們遭難的日子， 你不該口出狂言；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10031001013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "俄巴底亞書 1:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "31001013",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;我子民遭難的日子， 你不該闖進他們的城； 他們遭難的日子， 你不該幸災樂禍； 他們遭難的日子， 你不該趁火打劫；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10031001014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "俄巴底亞書 1:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "31001014",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;你不該站在路口截殺那些逃亡者； 他們遭難的日子， 你不該把倖存者交給仇敵。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10031001015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "俄巴底亞書 1:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "31001015",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;「耶和華懲罰萬國的日子近了。 必按你的所作所為報應你， 你的惡行必落到自己頭上。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10031001016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "俄巴底亞書 1:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "31001016",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;猶大人在我的聖山上怎樣飽飲憤怒， 萬國也要照樣不停地喝， 且要大口吞下， 直到他們完全消逝。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10031001017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "俄巴底亞書 1:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "31001017",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;「然而，錫安山必成為避難所， 成為聖地。 雅各家必得到自己的產業。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10031001018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "俄巴底亞書 1:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "31001018",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;雅各家將成為火， 約瑟家將成為烈焰， 以掃家將成為碎稭， 被火焚燒、吞噬，無一人逃脫。 這是耶和華說的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10031001019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "俄巴底亞書 1:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "31001019",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;「南地的人將佔領以掃山； 丘陵的人將佔領非利士， 奪取以法蓮和撒瑪利亞； 便雅憫人將佔領基列。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10031001020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "俄巴底亞書 1:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "31001020",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;被擄的以色列人將佔領迦南人的土地，遠至撒勒法； 從耶路撒冷被擄到西法拉的人將佔領南地各城。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10031001021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "俄巴底亞書 1:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "31001021",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;拯救者必登上錫安山， 統治以掃山， 耶和華必做王掌權。」</p>"
  }
]